@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
actor User
participant Launcher
participant system_server
participant Zygote
participant AppProcess
participant ART
participant Activity
participant SurfaceFlinger
User -> Launcher : tap icon
Launcher -> system_server : launch intent
system_server -> Zygote : request process
Zygote -> AppProcess : fork / specialise UID
AppProcess -> ART : attach runtime / load classes
ART -> Activity : create Application and Activity
Activity -> SurfaceFlinger : render first frame
@enduml
